13
01:19:22,105 --> 01:19:28,105
Courage Under Fire is a 1996 American war drama film directed by
Edward Zwick, and starring Denzel Washington and Meg Ryan.

14
01:25:28,421 --> 01:25:34,421
It is the second collaboration between Washington and director Zwick.

15
01:31:34,736 --> 01:31:40,736
The film was released in the United States on July 12, 1996, to
positive reviews and grossed $100 million worldwide.

16
01:37:41,052 --> 01:37:47,052
It was also the first movie to be produced by Fox 2000 Pictures two
years after the company was established in 1994.

17
01:43:47,368 --> 01:43:53,368
The film explores themes of gulf war, war veteran, politics, praise, pilot.

